<h1 data-copy-en="Neena" data-copy-zh="Neena">Neena</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Neena’s current schedule and the dates, H2Hs and story steps needed for recruitment." data-copy-zh="查清Neena的出没安排，以及招募所需的约会、谈心与个人事件。">Find Neena’s current schedule and the dates, H2Hs and story steps needed for recruitment.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Army_Recruitment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Private_Terms_.E2.80.94_Once-Only_Personal_Scene"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Private_Terms_—_Once-Only_Personal_Scene"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Open_Sightlines_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Same_Quiet_Corner_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_Personal_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_False_Interpretation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Permission_to_Proceed"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Before_the_Metal"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Scene_Replies_and_Totals"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Nine_Automatic_Personal_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Tactical_Awareness_Lesson"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Talk_and_Wine"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Neena — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/neena.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Neena — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/neena.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Neena — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Neena becomes available through the main story and has a nine-scene personal route, three H2Hs, two dates, a tactical lesson and a one-time private scene. Her later army recruitment also changes her everyday portrait schedule. This guide leaves her personal history and scene outcomes for play.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Portrait_Schedule_Before_and_After_Recruitment"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>After Story 68, visit Hyperloop Transit Nexus for Story 69. Once it is complete, Neena is at the stronghold’s Armory all day until By Her Own Authority.</p><p>After that personal recruitment milestone: Armory every day 00:00–11:59, Operations Center every day 12:00–17:59, then Armory on odd days 18:00–23:59 or Robot Bar on even days 18:00–23:59. Her ordinary actions follow her portrait. Automatic personal scenes keep their specified trigger locations.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Main-Story_Participation_Without_Story_Reveals"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Begin at Acknowledged (10) with Terms of Occupancy. Continue through the automatic scenes below, inserting the three H2Hs and both dates when their gates open. The two dates are required parts of this personal chain.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Terms of Occupancy</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Armory; 06:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); after Story 69</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Adequate Repairs</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Armory; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); after Terms of Occupancy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No True Believer</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Armory; 18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after Adequate Repairs</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Twenty-Three, Eleven, None</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Armory; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Same Quiet Corner with Neena / Before the Metal</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Doctrine Has Exits</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Armory; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Twenty-Three, Eleven, None</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Voice Without Faith</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Armory; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Doctrine Has Exits / Permission to Proceed</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Patient Breach</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Armory; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after A Voice Without Faith / Open Sightlines with Neena</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No One Gave the Order</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Armory; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); after The Patient Breach / No False Interpretation</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">By Her Own Authority</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Operations Center; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Intimate (1600); after No One Gave the Order</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Before the Metal</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); after No True Believer</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">75 min; 10 Energy; restores 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Permission to Proceed</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after Doctrine Has Exits / Before the Metal</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 15 Energy; restores 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No False Interpretation</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Crush (400); after The Patient Breach / Permission to Proceed</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 15 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Same Quiet Corner Date follows Before the Metal and is required for Twenty-Three, Eleven, None. Open Sightlines Date follows A Voice Without Faith and is required for The Patient Breach. No False Interpretation then allows the later personal scenes.</p><p>By Her Own Authority starts at Operations Center, 08:00–21:59, at Intimate (1,600), after No One Gave the Order. It recruits her Army unit and changes her portrait schedule; you do not need to purchase a separate portrait recruitment action.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Neena</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Wine</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Wine</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+9 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tactical Awareness</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25); Intelligence 15; supporter access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">160 min; $250; 30 Energy; 20 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">learn Tactical Awareness once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Same Quiet Corner Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); after Before the Metal; 18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $75; 15 Energy; restores 15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Open Sightlines Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after A Voice Without Faith; 17:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">150 min; $125; 20 Energy; restores 20 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Terms</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Romantic (800); after No False Interpretation; supporter access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; 25 Energy; restores 20 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk gives 1 base affection, five times daily. Wine opens at Known (25), consumes one Wine, and gives 9 base affection once daily. The Tactical Awareness lesson needs Known and Intelligence 15, takes 160 minutes, $250, 30 Energy and 20 Calm, and requires the supporter access shown by its lock.</p><p>Private Terms opens at Romantic (800) after No False Interpretation, with the required supporter access. It takes 180 minutes and 25 Energy, restores 20 Calm, and completes once. It is a separate personal scene, not a repeatable daily video.</p><p>Her automatic route does not require that skill lesson as a substitute for the named dates or H2Hs.</p><p>Her favorite stats are Perception, Ability, Intelligence. The learned Tactical Awareness skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. H2Hs and automatic personal scenes complete once; ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>No portrait: complete Story 69, then use Armory.</li><li>An early scene is missing overnight: Terms of Occupancy starts from 06:00 and Adequate Repairs from 08:00; No True Believer starts in the evening.</li><li>A later scene is blocked: check the actual completed date, not just the affection threshold.</li><li>After recruitment, she changes locations at noon and 18:00; Robot Bar is used on even-numbered evenings.</li><li>Private Terms is once only. A used action is not an unfinished repeatable daily activity.</li><li>Automatic scene locations do not move with her portrait. Return to the listed room at the listed time.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — stages and dates</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">Army — Neena’s unit</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story progress</a></li><li><a href="character-ghost.html">Ghost — shared personal events</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Army_Recruitment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Private_Terms_.E2.80.94_Once-Only_Personal_Scene"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Private_Terms_—_Once-Only_Personal_Scene"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Open_Sightlines_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Same_Quiet_Corner_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_Personal_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_False_Interpretation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Permission_to_Proceed"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Before_the_Metal"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_Scene_Replies_and_Totals"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Nine_Automatic_Personal_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Tactical_Awareness_Lesson"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Talk_and_Wine"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Neena 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/neena.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Neena 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/neena.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Neena 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Neena通过主线登场，个人路线包含九场事件、三次谈心、两场约会、战术课程和一次私人事件。后续加入军队时，平日头像的出没地点也会改变。她的个人经历与事件结果留在游戏中了解。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Portrait_Schedule_Before_and_After_Recruitment"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>完成主线68后，到超环交通枢纽触发主线69。完成后，Neena在要塞军械库全天可见，直到“凭她自己的决定权”。</p><p>完成这个个人招募节点后：每天00:00–11:59在军械库、12:00–17:59在作战中心；18:00–23:59则单数日在军械库，双数日在机器人酒吧。普通行动跟随头像，自动个人事件仍保留各自指定的触发地点。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Main-Story_Participation_Without_Story_Reveals"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>达到已遇见（10）后，从“居住条款”开始。按下表推进自动事件，并在条件满足时穿插三次谈心与两场约会；这两场约会都是个人路线的实际前置。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">居住条款</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">军械库; 06:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）；完成：主线69</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">尚可的维修</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">军械库; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；完成：居住条款</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">并非真正的信徒</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">军械库; 18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：尚可的维修</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">二十三，十一，无一</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">军械库; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：与Neena在同一个安静角落、金属之前</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">教义也有出口</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">军械库; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：二十三，十一，无一</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">没有信仰的声音</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">军械库; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：教义也有出口、下一步的许可</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">耐心的突破行动</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">军械库; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：没有信仰的声音、与Neena共享开阔视野</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">无人下令</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">军械库; 08:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）；完成：耐心的突破行动、不容误解</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">凭她自己的决定权</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">作战中心; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密（1600）；完成：无人下令</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">金属之前</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；完成：并非真正的信徒</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">75分钟；10精力；恢复5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">下一步的许可</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；完成：教义也有出口、金属之前</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；15精力；恢复5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不容误解</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">迷恋（400）；完成：耐心的突破行动、下一步的许可</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；15精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>“安静角落约会”要先完成“金属之前”，也是“二十三，十一，无一”的前置。“开阔视野约会”在“没有信仰的声音”后开放，是“耐心的突破行动”的前置。之后还要完成“不容误解”，才能继续后期个人事件。</p><p>达到亲密（1600）、完成“无人下令”后，08:00–21:59进入作战中心触发“凭她自己的决定权”。完成后获得她的军队单位，并改变头像出没安排，不另需要从头像购买招募。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Neena交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送葡萄酒</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；葡萄酒×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+9；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">战术意识</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）；智力15；满足锁形提示所示的支持者内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">160分钟；$250；30精力；20镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">学习战术意识，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">安静角落约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；完成：金属之前；18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$75；15精力；恢复15镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">开阔视野约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；完成：没有信仰的声音；17:00–22:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">150分钟；$125；20精力；恢复20镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私密条款</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">浪漫感（800）；完成：不容误解；满足锁形提示所示的支持者内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；25精力；恢复20镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>交谈给1基础好感、每天5次。已知（25）后可送葡萄酒，每次消耗1份，给9基础好感、每天一次。战术意识课程需要已知及智力15，消耗160分钟、$250、30精力与20镇定，并需要锁形提示所示的支持者内容权限。</p><p>“私密条款”在浪漫感（800）、完成“不容误解”并满足支持者内容权限后开放，消耗180分钟、25精力，恢复20镇定，只能完成一次。这是独立个人事件，不能当成每日重复动画。</p><p>这门课不能代替路线里要求的约会或谈心。</p><p>她偏好的属性为感知、能力、智力。学会战术意识可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。谈心与个人自动事件只完成一次；普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>没有头像：先完成主线69，再去军械库。</li><li>凌晨没有前期事件：“居住条款”从06:00开始，“尚可的维修”从08:00开始，“并非真正的信徒”则在晚上。</li><li>后续事件卡住：检查是否实际完成所需约会，不要只看好感阶段。</li><li>加入军队后，她在12:00和18:00换地点；双数日晚上要去机器人酒吧。</li><li>“私密条款”只能完成一次，使用过后不是待完成的每日活动。</li><li>自动事件的地点不会随头像移动，应按表列地点和时间重新进入。</li></ul></section>
